      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0C2C00551D33A5DC",
      "text": "그 말을 들으니\\n세이지, Very very 해피한걸![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "E26A4EA09EC2A1DA",
      "text": "Oh... 세이지, So Sad~!\\n몸에 익히기 쉬운 수업을 지향했건만![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0C2BFF551D33A429",
      "text": "그렇다면, 블루베리의 Students에게 할\\nLesson에도 더욱 심혈을 기울여야겠어![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0C2BFE551D33A276",
      "text": "최선을 다할 테니\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]도 Fighting~![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
