    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3A95016D2A285162",
      "text": "또 초대해 줘서\\nVery very 고마워~![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3A95026D2A285315",
      "text": "여러 지방을 왔다 갔다 하니\\n옛날의 Memory가 새록새록 떠오르더군![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "D5B856845D611BF4",
      "text": "옛날의 Memory요?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "D5B859845D61210D",
